    "51": "By Legendre's formula, the exponent of \\(3\\) in \\(50!\\) is \\(\\left\\lfloor\\frac{50}{3}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{50}{9}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{50}{27}\\right\\rfloor=16+5+1=22\\). Hence the largest \\(n\\) with \\(3^{n}\\mid 50!\\) is \\(22\\)."
  },
